#. i18n: file: klipper.kcfg:22
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (StripWhiteSpace), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:106
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the selected text has some whitespace at the end, which, if "
"loaded as URL in a browser would cause an error. Enabling this option "
"removes any whitespace at the beginning or end of the selected string (the "
"original clipboard contents will not be modified)."
msgstr ""
"Pa des côps, li tecse tchoezi a des blancs al fén, çou ki, dins ene hårdêye "
"po on betchteu waibe metans, pout fé des rujhes. Avou cisse tchuze ci les "
"blancs k' i gn a al fén ou å cmince d' ene tchinne di tecse tchoezeye seront "
"rsaetchîs (li contnou oridjinnå do tchapea emacralé n' serè nén candjî)."

#. i18n: file: klipper.kcfg:25
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ReplayActionInHistory), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:109
msgid "Replay action in history"
msgstr "Rifé l' faitindje e l' istwere"

#. i18n: file: klipper.kcfg:31
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (PreventEmptyClipboard), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:115
msgid ""
"Selecting this option has the effect, that the clipboard can never be "
"emptied. E.g. when an application exits, the clipboard would usually be "
"emptied."
msgstr ""
"Avou cisse tchuze ci, li tchapea emacralé n' pout måy esse vudî. Metans "
"cwand on programe est cloyou, normålmint l' tchapea emacralé est vudî."

#. i18n: file: klipper.kcfg:36
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (IgnoreSelection), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:121
msgid ""
"This option prevents the selection being recorded in the clipboard history. "
"Only explicit clipboard changes are recorded."
msgstr ""
"Cisse tchuze ci espaitche ki l' tchoes ni soeye wårdé dins l' istwere do "
"tchapea emacralé. Seulmint les candjmints esplicites do tchapea emacralé "
"sont rashious."

#. i18n: file: klipper.kcfg:43
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Synchronize), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:127
msgid "Synchronize clipboard and selection"
msgstr "Sincronijhî l' tchapea emacralé et l' tchoes"

#. i18n: file: klipper.kcfg:47
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SelectionTextOnly), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:130
msgid "Selection text only"
msgstr "Kel tecse tchoezi"

#. i18n: file: klipper.kcfg:49
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (SelectionTextOnly), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:133
msgid ""
"<qt>There are two different clipboard buffers available:<br /><br /"
"><b>Clipboard</b> is filled by selecting something and pressing Ctrl+C, or "
"by clicking \"Copy\" in a toolbar or menubar.<br /><br /><b>Selection</b> is "
"available immediately after selecting some text. The only way to access the "
"selection is to press the middle mouse button.<br /><br />You can configure "
"the relationship between Clipboard and Selection.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>I gn a deus tampons diferins pol copyî/aclaper:<br /><br />Li <b>tchapea "
"emacralé</b> est rimpli tot tchoezixhant ene sacwè eyet tchôcant so Ctrl+C, "
"ou clitchant so «Copyî» dins on menu ou dins ene bår ås usteyes.<br /><br /"
">Li <b>tchoes</b> est disponibe do côp k' on tchoezixhe on tecse al sori. Li "
"seule manire d' aveur accès al seleccion c' est di l' aclaper tot clitchant "
"avou l' boton do mitan del sori.<br /><br />Vos ploz apontyî li relåcion "
"k' i gn a inte li tchapea emacralé eyet l' tchoes.</qt>"

